{
  "name": "magpie-plugin-scaffold",
  "version": "0.1.7",
  "description": "A magpie / OpenCode provider plugin scaffold: all nine hooks implemented in one file, plus the enforceable rules a provider plugin must pass — icon in two places, MIT license, no helper functions exported, no secrets. Clone it, implement five functions, run the check.",
